  "limitations": "The equality classification is restricted to 2-connected graphs containing a clique on all but two vertices, so it is only a partial solution of the general Zhang-Li equality problem. Searches found no prior classification under equivalent near-complete terminology, but older chemical-graph literature and very recent unindexed work remain residual originality risks. Finite verification supports but does not replace the proof. No independent validation is asserted.",
